{%- comment -%}
  Icons for the Felice testimonials section (paths exported from Figma).
  Usage: {% render 'fa-icons-testimonials', icon: 'google' %}
  The prev/next arrows use the shared chevron in fa-icon (same Figma "chevron_backward" vector; Figma's 27.08px
  frame is the 20.31px one scaled 4/3, and the arrow CSS sizes it relative to the button).
  'star' is the rounded review star (currentColor). 'google' keeps its brand colours.
{%- endcomment -%}
